<title>UK: Rolls-Royce venture wins $100 mln of orders.</title>
<headline>Rolls-Royce venture wins $100 mln of orders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rolls-Royce Plc said its joint venture with Cooper Cameron Corporation had won orders for gas turbines totalling over $100 million.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the orders were for ten new gas turbines and the retrofit of four existing units.  </p>
<p>Rolls-Royce said seven of the new units were for gas transmission service in Canada with TransCanda Pipelines, two were for offshore oil and gas platforms while one unit was for power generation in southern Spain.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
